{
  "id": "03-analyst-fabric-workflow",
  "title": "The Fabric workflow beyond charts",
  "duration": 40.0853,
  "beats": [
    {
      "text": "If you already build Power BI reports, learn what happens before the chart.",
      "asset": "architecture",
      "device": "tile",
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 4.32,
      "voice_end": 4.16
    },
    {
      "text": "Fabric brings ingestion, engineering, storage, analytics and reporting into one platform.",
      "asset": "architecture",
      "device": "sequence",
      "start": 4.32,
      "end": 10.176,
      "voice_end": 10.016
    },
    {
      "text": "Start with a lakehouse. Understand where the data lands and how its tables are organized.",
      "asset": "hierarchy",
      "device": "focus",
      "key": "Lakehouse",
      "start": 10.176,
      "end": 15.2853,
      "voice_end": 15.1253
    },
    {
      "text": "Then trace an ingestion pipeline. What arrives, what changes, and what happens when a run fails?",
      "asset": "pipeline",
      "device": "sequence",
      "start": 15.2853,
      "end": 20.9707,
      "voice_end": 20.8107
    },
    {
      "text": "Keep SQL and Power BI. Add the shared data layer underneath them.",
      "asset": "onelake",
      "device": "focus",
      "start": 20.9707,
      "end": 25.2693,
      "voice_end": 25.1093
    },
    {
      "text": "Fabric data agents can turn questions into queries against supported data sources.",
      "asset": "agent-ask",
      "device": "focus",
      "key": "Data agents",
      "start": 25.2693,
      "end": 30.5067,
      "voice_end": 30.3467
    },
    {
      "text": "That makes a clean model and clear permissions useful beyond the report itself.",
      "asset": "agent-sources",
      "device": "sequence",
      "start": 30.5067,
      "end": 34.9973,
      "voice_end": 34.8373
    },
    {
      "text": "Build one small workflow from source to report. Explain each step and show its output.",
      "asset": "architecture",
      "device": "focus",
      "start": 34.9973,
      "end": 40.0853,
      "voice_end": 39.9253
    }
  ],
